post_install() {
    cat << 'EOF'

================================================================================
                    ⚠️  UNOFFICIAL PACKAGE - GENERATED BY BOB  ⚠️
================================================================================

This UNOFFICIAL package for IBM Bob IDE was generated by Bob itself.
NOT officially supported or endorsed by IBM Corporation.

IBM Bob IDE is PROPRIETARY SOFTWARE owned by IBM Corporation.

YOU MUST:
  • Comply with IBM's license terms
  • Obtain proper licensing from IBM
  • Accept IBM's terms of service

SUPPORT:
  • IBM Bob IDE issues → Contact IBM (https://ibm.com)
  • Packaging issues → AUR or John McAvoy <j-mcavoy@protonmail.com>

DISCLAIMER:
This packaging is "AS IS" without warranty. Maintainer is NOT affiliated
with IBM and does NOT provide official IBM support.

By using this package, you accept all risks and agree to comply with IBM's
license terms. IBM support does not cover this unofficial package.

Full license: /usr/share/licenses/ibm-bobide/LICENSE

To launch: bobide

================================================================================

EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
    cat << 'EOF'

================================================================================
IBM Bob IDE Updated - UNOFFICIAL PACKAGE
================================================================================

Reminder: This is an unofficial package not endorsed by IBM.
You must comply with IBM's license terms.

================================================================================

EOF
}

post_remove() {
    cat << 'EOF'

================================================================================
IBM Bob IDE Removed
================================================================================

User data may remain in:
  ~/.config/bobide/
  ~/.local/share/bobide/

To remove: rm -rf ~/.config/bobide ~/.local/share/bobide

================================================================================

EOF
}